{"4018220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SQUIDWAR: PvP ROGUELIKE", "steam_appid": 4018220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of space lies <strong>Squidonia</strong>, a planet that once basked in radiant glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/ed5c41ec2131f0fdda52276479bbae2a.poster.avif?t=1757981836\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/ed5c41ec2131f0fdda52276479bbae2a.webm?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/ed5c41ec2131f0fdda52276479bbae2a.mp4?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>At the heart of its prosperity was the legendary <strong>Squid Crystal</strong>—a source of endless energy that granted power and survival to countless squids, making Squidonia the center of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day… the crystal vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet fell into decline, and from the void, <br>powerful <strong>Alpha Bosses</strong> from neighboring worlds began to awaken.<br><br>In truth, they had long been waging secret wars, building their strength to claim the shattered fragments of the crystal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Boss Incoming!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/af3fa97e1934564ce1c8052b2d0d497c.poster.avif?t=1757981836\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/af3fa97e1934564ce1c8052b2d0d497c.webm?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/af3fa97e1934564ce1c8052b2d0d497c.mp4?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mighty bosses of each world have arrived.<br>Rivals must put aside their battles and fight together to survive.<br>Study each boss’s unique attack patterns, defeat them, and claim the Squid Crystal for yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦑 <strong>Unique Skills for Every Warrior</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/e33ea94d151233fec09dd9d92363eeb7.poster.avif?t=1757981836\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/e33ea94d151233fec09dd9d92363eeb7.webm?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/e33ea94d151233fec09dd9d92363eeb7.mp4?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each squid warrior comes with their own distinctive abilities.<br>Unleash different skills to outsmart and overwhelm your opponents on the battlefield!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💎 <strong>Endless Growth Through Level-Ups</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/e3b219ff1241007f50b9d4a2914571ba.poster.avif?t=1757981836\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/e3b219ff1241007f50b9d4a2914571ba.webm?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/e3b219ff1241007f50b9d4a2914571ba.mp4?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems to grow stronger, round after round.<br>With every battle, return more powerful and ready to take on greater challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who survive will uncover the truth.<br>Defeat the bosses, reclaim the crystal, and carve your legend in the endless fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of <strong>Squidonia</strong> rests in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of space lies <strong>Squidonia</strong>, a planet that once basked in radiant glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/ed5c41ec2131f0fdda52276479bbae2a.poster.avif?t=1757981836\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/ed5c41ec2131f0fdda52276479bbae2a.webm?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018220/extras/ed5c41ec2131f0fdda52276479bbae2a.mp4?t=1757981836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>At the heart of its prosperity was the legendary <strong>Squid Crystal</strong>—a source of endless energy that granted power and survival to countless squids, making Squidonia the center of the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day… the crystal vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet fell into decline, and from the void, <br>powerful <strong>Alpha Bosses</strong> from neighboring worlds began to awaken.<br><br>In truth, they had long been waging secret wars, building their strength to claim the shattered fragments of the crystal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Boss Incoming!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay 